{"overview":"آرز لوونت در دنیای دیگری به عنوان پسر جوان یک اشراف‌زاده کوچک که یک قلمرو محدود دارد، تجسد می‌کند. آرز نه خاصاً قوی است و نه هوشمند، اما مهارت ارزیابی را به‌دست آورده که می‌تواند توانایی‌ها و وضعیت دیگران را ببیند. او از این مهارت برای کشف بهترین استعدادهای پنهان جهان استفاده می‌کند تا قلمرو کوچک و ضعیف خود را به بهترین تبدیل کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Ars Louvent is reincarnated in another world as the young son of a minor noble who owns a small domain. Ars is not particularly strong or intelligent, but he was born with the Appraisal Skill that's able to see others' abilities and statuses. He uses his skill to find the best hidden talents in the world to make their small, weak domain into the best.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":27,"y":2024,"poster":"/yF9t1erLr7qZu17cTiXggyUcS3R.jpg"}],"episodes":26,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"藤原夏海","role":"Ars Louvent (voice)","photo":"/9B9NICRp2li1SA3VF7vyIAxQ0x9.jpg","en":"Natsumi Fujiwara"},{"name":"坂泰斗","role":"Ritsu Muses (voice)","photo":"/pSExEOVmjAujKUyJJJSxC1WEzOM.jpg","en":"Taito Ban"},{"name":"佳穂成美","role":"Charlotte Wraith (voice)","photo":"/9QKQnv8C9usNDeg3z1B9j7qwJxX.jpg","en":"Narumi Kaho"},{"name":"岡咲美保","role":"Rosell Kischa (voice)","photo":"/cTkMJzOdsXL8o5q5AhP9eT0sXDK.jpg","en":"Miho Okasaki"},{"name":"花澤香菜","role":"Licia Plaid (voice)","photo":"/9UTBlNRopSOKyoWnCm74tyHOfR1.jpg","en":"Kana Hanazawa"},{"name":"東地宏樹","role":"Raven Louvent / Narration (voice)","photo":"/bU2vogWmnTWiQEwUADWlnBqAPhJ.jpg","en":"Hiroki Touchi"},{"name":"生天目仁美","role":"Mireille Grangeon (voice)","photo":"/jidfw5qDgZjC4TPY3YunJQxlEmr.jpg","en":"Hitomi Nabatame"},{"name":"戸松遥","role":"Fam (voice)","photo":"/geVvuA2zMGE5xzfc20aDelJSelu.jpg","en":"Haruka Tomatsu"},{"name":"田中有紀","role":"Selena Bandol (voice)","photo":"/lRkWo2ZKuAiEruXlbHGgyjJjuUr.jpg","en":"Yuki Tanaka"}],"trailer":"QCtat7cw8CU","watch":{"US":{"link":"https:/